--Description: 
--  Year‑by‑year patent‑filing counts and exponential moving average (EMA, α = 0.2)
--  for CPC symbol ‘A61K008/00’, using ONLY the first CPC code (array index 0)
--  of each publication.  A single WITH RECURSIVE block is employed so the
--  recursive CTE (ema_r) can reference the preparatory CTEs defined above it.
